              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yonasaani yaazaara Meribubaali, Meribu-baali yaazaara Miika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabani ba Miika: Pisoni, Meleki, Tarea na Ahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi yaazaara Yehoada, Yehoada yaazaara Alemeesi, Azimaveesi na Zimuri, Zimuri yaazaara Mooza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mooza yaazaara Binea; mwene Binea ni Raafa, mwene Raafa ni Eleasa, mwene Eleasa ni Azeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azeeli akaba aine aboojo mukaaga, n'amaziina gaabo nigo aga, Azurikaamu, Bokeru, Ishimaeli, Shearia, Obadia na Hanani. Abo boona ni beene Azeeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beene Esheki omurumuna: Ulaamu omujigaijo gwe, omushubiro Yeushi, n'owa kashatu Elifeleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beene Ulaamu bakaba bari abarwani b'amaani, enkwata-mata, kandi bakaba baine abatabani n'abaijukuru baingi, omubaro gwabo guri igana na makumi ataano. Abo boona bakaba bari Ababenyamiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
